  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that multimodal models with scvi_n200 RNA encoder, imagenet_vit_l image encoder, and transformer aggregation achieve high accuracy (e.g., config_039: 0.724989). This experiment tests whether using scvi_n200 RNA encoder with avgpool aggregation in a rna_only setting (config_005) can match or exceed this performance, clarifying if the RNA encoder type or aggregation method is more critical. It balances exploration of RNA-only models with the need to validate key components from high-performing multimodal configurations."
}

